MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Kreg screw kit connects directly to my recent wood screw purchases, so it feels relevant to the fastening supplies I am considering.",
    "Offering screws in several sizes makes sense for possible woodworking needs, although I would check whether pocket-hole screws fit my projects before choosing them."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Cutting wheels, feeler gauges, and electrical connector kits serve different tasks from fastening wood; needing screws does not give me a reason to buy those supplies now.",
    "Epoxy, glue, hose clamps, tape, and a safety can each need a specific application that my recent purchases do not establish. The ten-pack of glue also exceeds my current needs."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The recommendations seem to treat a broad connection to tools and repair supplies as enough to match my current needs.",
    "They seem to assume that buying supplies for one practical task means I am also preparing for unrelated electrical, metalworking, and storage tasks."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated purchases of framing nails and wood screws suggest a more specific interest in mechanical fastening, especially for wood.",
    "Dimensions, intended use, and compatibility matter to me: even another screw product is only useful if it suits the work and equipment I have."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly recognized my fastening needs but stretched that interest into unrelated repair and workshop tasks."
}
